Package: korefileformat
Type: Package
Title: KORE High-Performance File Compression Format
Version: 1.3.2
Authors@R: person("Sai Arun Kumar", "Katherashala",
    email = "arunkatherashala@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read and write KORE (.kore) compressed files. KORE is a
    high-performance columnar compression format achieving 87%+ compression
    ratios with streaming support for files of any size. Provides pure-R
    bindings for reading KORE metadata and data, plus utilities for
    converting data frames to and from the KORE format.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/arunkatherashala/Kore
BugReports: https://github.com/arunkatherashala/Kore/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
